# Claude Code writes to this file itself: /model, /effort, permission approvals, and
# auto mode environment profiles all land here. Those profiles can contain internal
# hostnames, addresses, and credential scopes, and this repo has public remotes.
.claude/settings.json

# The pre_commit leak guard's org-specific term list. The terms are the
# sensitive part, so the list stays local while the hook itself is tracked.
.config/yadm/hooks/leak-patterns.txt
